#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:5
#: af012a9a800041d8927b41433d40fdf9
msgid "3DR Solo - Initial ArduCopter Install Using Solex"
msgstr "3DR Solo - 使用Solex初始安装ArduCopter"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:7
#: 2103db9bb8464e299c78b759b0b33742
msgid ""
"These are detailed instructions for the installation of ArduCopter on the "
"3DR Solo using the Solex app for Android. **Your solo should be in safe "
"working order before you start**. It should not be malfunctioning or "
"unreliable before you even begin. It must be up to date with the latest 3DR "
"firmware. You cannot do this with a straight out of the box Solo. You must "
"go through the full pre-flight update first on a new Solo.  Once your Solo "
"is up to date and working well, you're ready to begin this process."
msgstr ""
"以下是在3DR "
"Solo上使用Android版Solex应用安装ArduCopter的详细说明。**开始之前，您的Solo应处于安全可用的工作状态**。在开始之前，Solo不应存在故障或不可靠的情况。Solo必须更新到最新的3DR固件。您不能在刚开箱的Solo上执行此操作。新Solo必须先完成完整的飞行前更新。Solo更新完毕并正常工作后，您就可以开始此过程了。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:9
#: 27f4ed051e85414484d4c3fb48b390e6
msgid ""
"If you need help troubleshooting a problem during with this process or have "
"questions, the `Solo Beta Test Facebook group "
"<https://www.facebook.com/groups/617648671719759/>`_ is the best place to "
"go."
msgstr ""
"如果在此过程中遇到问题需要帮助，或有疑问，`Solo Beta Test Facebook群组 "
"<https://www.facebook.com/groups/617648671719759/>`_ 是最佳求助地点。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:12
#: 6c7073769d004543b218882409562975
msgid ""
"**1) Download required files to Solex:** While your device has an internet "
"connection, Go in the Solex menu all the way at the bottom, and select "
"*Firmware Updates*. If you don't see Firmware Updates in the main menu, go "
"to the *application settings* and make sure advanced mode is enabled.  Once "
"you're in *Firmware Updates*, hit the refresh button to see the latest files"
" from the server.  Tap each of the required packages to download them. The "
"available status will change to downloaded for each one. As of this writing,"
" the 4 required packages are:"
msgstr ""
"**1) 下载所需文件到 Solex：** 在设备联网状态下，进入 Solex 菜单，滚动到最底部，选择 *Firmware "
"Updates*。如果主菜单中看不到 Firmware Updates，请进入 *application settings*，确保已启用高级模式。进入 "
"*Firmware Updates* "
"后，点击刷新按钮查看服务器上的最新文件。依次点击所需的安装包进行下载，每个安装包的状态将从\"可用\"变为\"已下载\"。撰写本文时，需下载的 4 "
"个安装包为："

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:14
#: ab8d771c862b4bf198fcae7d420ea422
msgid "``IMX Python Files``"
msgstr "``IMX Python Files``"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:15
#: bd7aa0301cfa4df4bf81551c633b5aab
msgid "``Wipe New Pixhawk Firmware.zip``"
msgstr "``Wipe New Pixhawk Firmware.zip``"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:16
#: 23a191191eab48cbb070a86d5d1f7bbb
msgid "``ArduCopter 3.5.x Firmware.zip``"
msgstr "``ArduCopter 3.5.x Firmware.zip``"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:17
#: 2375c569745d4bba87c0573c8fbe4b5e
msgid "``ArduCopter 3.5.x Parameters.zip``"
msgstr "``ArduCopter 3.5.x Parameters.zip``"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:18
#: f765f76657994281b43032a4e6f0b757
msgid ""
"``HERE Compass Parameters.zip`` *only if you have installed the HERE "
"external GPS/Compass*"
msgstr "``HERE Compass Parameters.zip`` *仅在您已安装 HERE 外部 GPS/罗盘时需要*"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:22
#: afb4f21929554dbba71299536f44f90c
msgid ""
"**2) Update python files:** Before doing anything else, you must load the "
"new python files onto the Solo's IMX companion computer. Connect to the Solo"
" with Solex. In the Solex Firmware Updates menu select the ``IMX Python "
"Files.zip`` package. Read the notice and select *install*. All the files "
"will be copied to the Solo in all the right places. When prompted, power "
"cycle the Solo. The files are compiled on reboot. It is critical that this "
"step take places **before** you install the Pixhawk 2.1 Green Cube in your "
"solo!"
msgstr ""
"**2) 更新 Python 文件：** 在执行任何其他操作之前，必须先将新的 Python 文件加载到 Solo 的 IMX 伴飞计算机上。使用 "
"Solex 连接到 Solo，在 Solex 固件更新菜单中选择 ``IMX Python Files.zip`` 安装包，阅读提示后选择 "
"*install*。所有文件将被复制到 Solo 的正确位置。根据提示重启 Solo，文件将在重启时编译。**在将 Pixhawk 2.1 Green "
"Cube 安装到 Solo 之前**，必须先完成此步骤，这一点至关重要！"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:24
#: 01c6875211c8440ca84c77570898bb2b
msgid ""
"**3) Remove the battery tray:** Remove the battery and pop off the GPS "
"cover.  Then unscrew all the small black screws around the battery tray. The"
" battery tray can now be lifted up.  Carefully unplug the GPS from the "
"carrier board.  Set the battery tray aside."
msgstr ""
"**3) 取下电池托盘：** 取出电池并弹开 GPS 盖板，然后拧下电池托盘周围所有小黑螺丝。此时可以将电池托盘抬起。小心地将 GPS "
"从载板上拔下，将电池托盘放置一旁。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:29
#: 2c5ad72ebe0d4fc7a6225bddc205a8b9
msgid ""
"**4) Lift up the carrier board:** Locate the comparatively large silver "
"screw on the right side toward the front. Unscrew that and set it aside with"
" all the other screws..  The carrier board can now be lifted up very "
"carefully.  You will need to fidget with the wires from the motor pods a "
"bit. Unplugging the front left motor pod from the carrier board can make "
"this easier. The board will need to go up a bit, then shift back, then shift"
" up the rest of the way. The left side can go up higher than the right, "
"which is convenient.  It's kind of tight and generally annoying.  Be careful"
" not to break the small wires.  Don't break any of the other wires either.  "
"You will need to get the board high enough up to expose the Pixhawk mounted "
"underneath it.  It's the black cube looking device."
msgstr ""
"**4) 抬起载板：** "
"找到右侧靠前位置那颗相对较大的银色螺丝，将其拧下并与其他螺丝放在一起。现在可以非常小心地将载板抬起。您可能需要稍微拨弄一下来自电机舱的导线。将左前方电机舱从载板上拔出可以使操作更方便。载板需要先向上抬起一点，再向后移动，然后继续向上抬到位。左侧可以比右侧抬得更高，这很方便。整个过程比较紧凑，操作起来有些麻烦。注意不要弄断细小的导线，其他导线也要小心。需要将载板抬得足够高，以露出安装在其下方的"
" Pixhawk，即那个看起来像黑色方块的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:36
#: 4245b4906b6747808452610024e27c44
msgid ""
"**5) Unscrew the stock Pixhawk:** There are 4 very small screws on the top "
"of the carrier board. Unscrew them and set them aside. The stock Pixhawk can"
" now be removed. It will pull down off the carrier board. Set the stock "
"Pixhawk aside somewhere safe. You will want to keep it."
msgstr ""
"**5) 拧下原装 Pixhawk：** 载板顶部有 4 颗非常小的螺丝，将其拧下并放好。现在可以取下原装 "
"Pixhawk，向下将其从载板上拔出，并将其放在安全的地方保管好。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:41
#: acac02aaf66e44279db512f0fe68c249
msgid ""
"**6) Install the green cube:** The green cube installs the same way the old "
"one came off.  Plug it into the carrier board from the bottom.  Then put in "
"the four screws."
msgstr "**6) 安装绿色 Cube：** 绿色 Cube 的安装方式与旧 Cube 的拆除方式相同。从底部将其插入载板，然后装上四颗螺丝。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:45
#: 9c35a3e234d049e68084f0ddad646768
msgid ""
"**Do not reassemble yet:** It is best to do the initial firmware install "
"with the Solo still opened up. If anything goes wrong, it avoids having to "
"disassemble it again."
msgstr "**暂勿重新组装：** 最好在 Solo 仍处于打开状态时进行初始固件安装。如果出现任何问题，可以避免再次拆解。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:47
#: 999bb88e7889438b8ea71fe9c4cf5955
msgid ""
"**7) Power up the Solo and reconnect to controller:** Put the battery onto "
"the solo. It will just sit atop the carrier board. Obviously you should "
"avoid moving the Solo around too much at this point since the battery can "
"just fall off. So get everything situated first.  Turn on the battery.  The "
"solo will power up as usual. After a short while, the Solo will reconnect "
"with the controller as usual. It will probably give you all kinds of "
"warnings about calibration. This is normal and expected."
msgstr ""
"**7) 为 Solo 上电并重新连接遥控器：** 将电池放到 Solo 上，电池将直接放在载板顶部。由于电池可能会滑落，此时应尽量避免移动 "
"Solo。因此请先将所有东西安置好，再打开电池开关。Solo 将正常启动，片刻后 Solo "
"将与遥控器正常重连。可能会出现各种关于校准的警告，这是正常且预期的现象。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:49
#: 70d5e4d92e2e4c7185de5aebf6f059d0
msgid ""
"**8) Reconnect** your mobile device to Solo's WiFi and make sure Solex says "
"it is *connected to vehicle*."
msgstr "**8) 重新连接**您的移动设备到 Solo 的 WiFi，并确认 Solex 显示已 *connected to vehicle*。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:51
#: fe714c639c0045208dadeabf7f205462
msgid ""
"**9) Wipe The Pixhawk:** In the Solex firmware updates menu, tap the ``Wipe "
"New Pixhawk Firmware.zip`` package. Read the notice and select *install*. "
"All the files will be copied to the Solo in all the right places. When "
"prompted, power cycle the Solo. It will reboot, then switch into bootloader "
"mode. Normally you will see disco lights while it's doing this. But if the "
"LED driver isn't enabled, you may not. Don't worry. It's working. Give it "
"3-5 minutes to process. You may hear some clicks as the Pixhawk reboots. "
"After 3-5 minutes, you will hear some tones signalling completion. It will "
"come back to life, reconnecting with the controller and Solex."
msgstr ""
"**9) 擦除 Pixhawk：** 在 Solex 固件更新菜单中，点击 ``Wipe New Pixhawk Firmware.zip`` "
"安装包，阅读提示后选择 *install*。所有文件将被复制到 Solo 的正确位置。根据提示重启 Solo，Solo "
"将重启后进入引导程序模式。通常在此过程中您会看到炫彩灯光，但如果 LED 驱动未启用则可能看不到。不用担心，系统正在正常运行。请等待 3-5 "
"分钟处理。Pixhawk 重启时可能会听到一些咔哒声。3-5 分钟后，您将听到提示完成的音调，Solo 将恢复正常并重新连接遥控器和 Solex。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:54
#: 44bf1660976745bb9c53f5a690c0b1a9
msgid ""
"**10) Install ArduCopter:** In the Solex firmware updates menu, tap the "
"``ArduCopter 3.5.x Firmware.zip`` package. Read the notice and select "
"*install*. All the files will be copied to the Solo in all the right places."
" When prompted, power cycle the Solo. It will reboot, then switch into "
"bootloader mode. Normally you will see disco lights while it's doing this. "
"But if the LED driver isn't enabled, you may not. Don't worry. It's working."
" Give it 3-5 minutes to process. You may hear some clicks as the Pixhawk "
"reboots. After 3-5 minutes, you will hear some tones signalling completion. "
"It will come back to life, reconnecting with the controller and Solex."
msgstr ""
"**10) 安装 ArduCopter：** 在 Solex 固件更新菜单中，点击 ``ArduCopter 3.5.x Firmware.zip`` "
"安装包，阅读提示后选择 *install*。所有文件将被复制到 Solo 的正确位置。根据提示重启 Solo，Solo "
"将重启后进入引导程序模式。通常在此过程中您会看到炫彩灯光，但如果 LED 驱动未启用则可能看不到。不用担心，系统正在正常运行。请等待 3-5 "
"分钟处理。Pixhawk 重启时可能会听到一些咔哒声。3-5 分钟后，您将听到提示完成的音调，Solo 将恢复正常并重新连接遥控器和 Solex。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:56
#: f4abf034791e4350bbba2b9efd6d5690
msgid ""
"If the Solo doesn't seem to complete the firmware installations after about "
"5 minutes, power off the Solo and power it back on.  A few people have "
"experienced this. It took a few power cycles to get it go through. It is "
"unknown why this happens.  But in those cases, power cycling 1-4 times got "
"it to go."
msgstr ""
"如果 Solo 在约 5 分钟后似乎仍未完成固件安装，请关闭 Solo "
"后重新开机。少数用户曾遇到此情况，需要多次重启才能完成。原因尚不明确，但在这些情况下，重启 1-4 次即可解决问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:58
#: 97efc2fb9e9649089d60ff54ca55c616
msgid ""
"**11) Reset Parameters:** In the Solex firmware updates menu, tap the *Reset"
" Params* button. Read the notice and press *yes*. When prompted, power cycle"
" the solo.  (This step is redundant since the prior firmware wipe also reset"
" the parameters. We're doing this for good measure.)"
msgstr ""
"**11) 重置参数：** 在 Solex 固件更新菜单中，点击 *Reset Params* 按钮，阅读提示后按 *yes*。根据提示重启 "
"Solo。（此步骤与之前固件擦除时重置参数的操作重复，但我们仍建议执行以确保万无一失。）"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:60
#: 3affe9f5fa7c4c7aa2f3e61dff6778ad
msgid ""
"**12) Load Parameters:** In the Solex firmware updates menu, tap the "
"``ArduCopter 3.5.x Parameters.zip`` package. Read the notice and select "
"*Install*. The parameters will be written to the Solo's Pixhawk. When "
"prompted, power cycle the Solo. The solo will reboot and reconnect to the "
"controller and apps. You will notice the LEDs now look like an aircraft "
"rather than a car. Installation complete!"
msgstr ""
"**12) 加载参数：** 在 Solex 固件更新菜单中，点击 ``ArduCopter 3.5.x Parameters.zip`` "
"安装包，阅读提示后选择 *Install*。参数将被写入 Solo 的 Pixhawk。根据提示重启 Solo，Solo "
"将重启并重新连接遥控器和应用程序。您会注意到 LED 现在看起来像飞机而不是汽车的样式。安装完成！"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:62
#: 5fe09238b16b4d018ed239ce1e6f73a2
msgid ""
"If you have the HERE external compass installed, load the ``HERE Compass "
"Parameters.zip`` after the ArduCopter parameters and before rebooting. If "
"you have the stock leg compass, do not load the HERE compass package."
msgstr ""
"如果您安装了 HERE 外部罗盘，请在加载 ArduCopter 参数后、重启前加载 ``HERE Compass "
"Parameters.zip``。如果您使用的是原装机脚罗盘，则无需加载 HERE 罗盘参数包。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:64
#: d5b21954615f413ea904ba249e63b7e4
msgid ""
"**13) Reassemble the Solo:** Once all of the above steps are completed "
"successfully, you can reassemble the Solo. Make sure you don't have any "
"screws left over.  Make sure all the wires, including the GPS and motor "
"pods, are plugged back in. Be careful with the small green and white SMBUS "
"wires going to the battery connector."
msgstr ""
"**13) 重新组装 Solo：** 成功完成以上所有步骤后，即可重新组装 Solo。确保没有多余的螺丝，确保所有导线（包括 GPS "
"和电机舱的导线）均已重新插好。注意不要损坏连接电池接口的细小绿白色 SMBUS 导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:66
#: cdf7fd53590c4f7c8ab0a906227f6d18
msgid ""
"**14) Connect and Check:** Turn the Solo back on. Connect with any and all "
"apps you plan to use (3DR, Solex, Side Pilot, etc) and test functionality. "
"Run the turtle/rabbit sliders for speed and pan all the way to rabbit and "
"back down all the way to turtle. These sliders make changes to the "
"parameters. Running the sliders up and down ensure those parameters are set "
"the way they should be. Go through all the settings. Touch everything to set"
" and verify everything. Do not assume these settings stuck from before."
msgstr ""
"**14) 连接并检查：** 重新开启 Solo。使用您计划使用的所有应用程序（3DR、Solex、Side Pilot "
"等）连接并测试功能。将速度和云台的乌龟/兔子滑块分别拨到最大和最小。这些滑块会修改相应的参数，来回拨动可确保参数设置正确。逐一检查所有设置，触碰每个选项进行确认和验证，不要假设这些设置与之前相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:68
#: 0f6e3854be26458cabb6bb7fe8b67f2e
msgid ""
"**15) Calibrations:** Once all of this done, you will need to do the 3D "
"Accelerometer Calibration (aka Accel Cal, aka Level Calibration, AKA IMU "
"Calibration) and the compass calibration. Solex v1.4.9 and higher has these "
"calibrations in the menu. They work the same way they do in the 3DR Solo "
"application. - Do the level calibration first on an actual level surface, "
"such as a table. For each orientation, place Solo down gently, and let it "
"settle for about 5 seconds before clicking through to the next one. It must "
"remain perfectly still when you push the button, so hands off the aircraft! "
"Once calibration is complete, you must reboot the Solo. - The compass "
"calibration must be done outdoors in an open area, away from structures, "
"vehicles, and other metal objects. This applies to any vehicle running any "
"firmware, not just a Solo, and not just ArduCopter master. Once calibration "
"is complete, you must reboot the Solo."
msgstr ""
"**15) 校准：** 完成以上所有操作后，您需要进行 3D 加速度计校准（即 Accel Cal、水平校准、IMU 校准）和罗盘校准。Solex "
"v1.4.9 及更高版本的菜单中包含这些校准功能，使用方式与 3DR Solo 应用程序相同。- "
"首先在真正水平的表面（如桌面）上进行水平校准。每次放置时，轻柔地将 Solo 放下，静置约 5 "
"秒后再点击进行下一步。按下按钮时飞机必须保持完全静止，请勿触碰飞机！校准完成后必须重启 Solo。- "
"罗盘校准必须在室外开阔区域进行，远离建筑物、车辆和其他金属物体。这适用于任何运行任何固件的飞行器，不限于 Solo 或 ArduCopter "
"master。校准完成后必须重启 Solo。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:74
#: 365746e33fcb4ba5be22be288e4ed5ba
msgid "**16) FLY!** Once all of the above is complete, you are ready to fly!"
msgstr "**16) 起飞！** 完成以上所有步骤后，您已准备好起飞！"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_solex_install.rst:76
#: 6b2bdf95dda54467be8a9fd9d512c62b
msgid ""
":ref:`Return to the main upgrade page <solo_arduCopter_first_flight>` for "
"first flight details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Return to the main upgrade page <solo_arduCopter_first_flight>` "
"了解首次飞行详情。"
